              "type": "oauth2",
              "flow": "client_credentials",
              "accessTokenUrl": "/oidc/token",
              "credentials": {
                "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
                "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
              }
            }
          },
          "docs": "Create an organization that represents your business customer or partner. This should be called from the backend, using an admin access token (generated by a management app). <br><br>**Required permissions**: `organizations:create`, `orgs:create`."
